# Question: The sales dataset contains information about daily store purchases. 
What is the correct way to calculate the total_quantityfor each product_lineand product? 

Solution: 
  sales %>%
  group_by(product_line, product) %>%
  summarize(total_quantity = sum(quantity))

--====================================================================================================


